    {
      "key": "DESC_TALK_ETC_YUANSHAO",
      "kr": "\"사세삼공 명문가인 나 원본초를\n감히 누가 감당하겠는가!\"",
      "en": "\"I am Yuan Benchu, of a house with three excellencies in four generations.\nWho would dare stand against me!\"",
